# About

Import Layout.

## Page /about

Head:
    <title>About — Acme</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Who Acme is.">

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1 id="title">About</h1>
      <p id="body">Acme has been making anvils since 1949.</p>
    {end}

## Test: the layout wraps the page and marks About active

Expect that the text of "#title" is equal to "About".
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 3.
Expect that the text of "footer" is equal to "© Acme".
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "About".
